<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/czechoslovakia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Czechoslovakia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Czechoslovakia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Communist Party seizes full power in February</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/united-kingdom"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/United%20Kingdom.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>United Kingdom</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The National Health Service is founded</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/udaipur-state"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Udaipur%20State.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Udaipur State</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Udaipur joins the United State of Rajasthan; Bhupal Singh becomes Rajpramukh</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/hyderabad-state"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Hyderabad%20State.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Hyderabad State</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Indian army takes over the state in Operation Polo</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/myanmar"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Myanmar.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Myanmar</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Union of Burma becomes independent on 4 January</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/united-state-of-rajasthan"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/United%20State%20of%20Rajasthan.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>United State of Rajasthan</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Nine south-eastern states and two chiefships form a union with its capital at Kota (25 March)</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/united-state-of-rajasthan"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/United%20State%20of%20Rajasthan.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>United State of Rajasthan</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Udaipur joins and Nehru inaugurates the United State of Rajasthan (18 April)</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/union-of-south-africa"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Union%20of%20South%20Africa.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Union of South Africa</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">D. F. Malan’s National Party wins power and begins apartheid</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/judaism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Judaism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Judaism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The State of Israel is founded, three years after the end of the Holocaust</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-colombia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Colombia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Colombia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The assassination of Jorge Eliécer Gaitán sets off the Bogotazo and deepens La Violencia</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/anti-apartheid-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Anti-apartheid%20movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Anti-apartheid movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The National Party wins power and begins to build apartheid into law</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/socialist-federal-republic-of-yugoslavia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Socialist%20Federal%20Republic%20of%20Yugoslavia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Socialist Federal Republic of Yugoslavia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">On 28 June the Cominform expels Yugoslavia for 'nationalist elements' and 'Trotskyism'; Soviet troops mass on the Hungarian border and 16,000 suspected Cominformists go to Goli Otok.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/mandatory-palestine"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Mandatory%20Palestine.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Mandatory Palestine</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Mandate expires at midnight on 14–15 May; David Ben-Gurion declares the State of Israel, Arab armies cross the borders, and the 1948 war divides the territory.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/gold-coast-colony"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Gold%20Coast%20Colony.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Gold Coast Colony</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Rioting in Accra and other towns over ex-servicemen's pensions, housing and the foreign hold on the economy; Nkrumah and the UGCC's 'Big Six' are detained.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/velvet-revolution"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Velvet%20Revolution.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Velvet Revolution</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Communist Party seizes power in Czechoslovakia, beginning 41 years of one-party rule</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/negritude"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/N%C3%A9gritude.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Négritude</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Senghor’s Anthologie de la nouvelle poésie nègre et malgache appears with Jean-Paul Sartre’s preface “Black Orpheus”</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/zionism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Zionism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Zionism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Ben-Gurion declares the State of Israel; in the war of 1948–1949 an estimated 710,000 Palestinians are driven out</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/nationalism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Nationalism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Nationalism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">White Afrikaner nationalists take control of South Africa and impose apartheid, which lasts until 1994</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/mahatma-gandhi"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Mahatma%20Gandhi.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Mahatma Gandhi</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Nathuram Godse shoots him dead at Birla House in Delhi</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/dead-sea-scrolls"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Dead%20Sea%20Scrolls.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Dead Sea Scrolls</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Millar Burrows of the American Schools of Oriental Research announced the discovery</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/forbidden-city"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Forbidden%20City.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Forbidden City</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Part of the evacuated collection is shipped to Taiwan under orders of Chiang Kai-shek</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/lascaux"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Lascaux.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Lascaux</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The cave complex opens to the public</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/martin-luther-king-jr"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Martin%20Luther%20King%20Jr..png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Martin Luther King Jr.</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Graduates from Morehouse College with a Bachelor of Arts in sociology, aged nineteen</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/pacifism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Pacifism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Pacifism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Costa Rica abolishes its military</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/secularism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Secularism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Secularism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Universal Declaration of Human Rights protects freedom of religion in international law</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/pan-slavism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Pan-Slavism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Pan-Slavism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The split between Tito and Stalin ends the proposals to bring Bulgaria into a Greater Yugoslavia</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/gandhism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Gandhism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Gandhism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Gandhi is assassinated</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/ahmadiyya"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Ahmadiyya.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Ahmadiyya</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The second Caliph founds the city of Rabwah in Pakistan after the partition of India</span></li></ul></section>
